  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4626a54e19105b24e88e08abf90699ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level04
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Oath.LevelConfig
  levelIndex: 4
  title: "Cu\u1ED9c V\xE2y H\xE3m Kinh \u0110\xF4"
  location: "Kinh \u0111\xF4 Elaria"
  description: "Kinh \u0111\xF4 b\u1ECB bao v\xE2y t\u1EEB ba h\u01B0\u1EDBng. N\xE2ng c\u1EA5p th\xE1p, qu\u1EA3n l\xFD th\u1EDDi gian gi\u1EEFa c\xE1c \u0111\u1EE3t v\xE0 \u0111\u1ED1i m\u1EB7t v\u1EDBi qu\xE1i th\xFA huy\u1EC1n tho\u1EA1i."
  objective: "Gi\u1EEF v\u1EEFng kinh \u0111\xF4"
  sceneName: 13_Level04
  intro:
  - speaker: "L\xEDnh g\xE1c"
    text: "B\xE1o c\xE1o! \u0110\u1ECBch xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n \u1EDF b\u1EBFn b\u1EAFc, b\u1EDD \u0111\xF4ng v\xE0 b\u1EBFn nam. Ch\xFAng ta b\u1ECB bao v\xE2y!"
  - speaker: Veyr
    text: "Kinh \u0111\xF4 h\u01B0\u1EDFng \xE1nh s\xE1ng c\u1EE7a tinh th\u1EC3 su\u1ED1t tr\u0103m n\u0103m trong khi c\xE1c \u0111\u1EA3o xa ch\xECm trong b\xF3ng t\u1ED1i. H\xF4m nay, \xE1nh s\xE1ng s\u1EBD \u0111\u1ED5i ch\u1EE7."
  - speaker: Kael
    text: "\xC1nh s\xE1ng kh\xF4ng thu\u1ED9c v\u1EC1 ri\xEAng ai, Veyr. Nh\u01B0ng ta s\u1EBD kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EC3 ng\u01B0\u01A1i \u0111\u1ED1t tr\u1EE5i kinh \u0111\xF4."
  - speaker: Mira
    text: "H\u1EAFn c\xF2n tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i nh\u1EEFng qu\xE1i th\xFA c\u1ED5 x\u01B0a: s\xF3i, ng\u1EF1a \u0111\u1ECBa ng\u1EE5c, nh\xE2n m\xE3\u2026 v\xE0 c\u1EA3 S\u01B0 T\u1EED Nemea. N\xE2ng c\u1EA5p th\xE1p l\xEAn t\u1ED1i \u0111a!"
  outro:
  - speaker: Kael
    text: "Kinh \u0111\xF4 v\u1EABn \u0111\u1EE9ng v\u1EEFng\u2026 nh\u01B0ng Tr\xE1i Tim B\xECnh Minh \u0111ang rung chuy\u1EC3n."
  - speaker: Mira
    text: "Tr\u1EADn chi\u1EBFn \u0111\xE3 l\xE0m tinh th\u1EC3 m\u1EA5t \u1ED5n \u0111\u1ECBnh. Veyr \u0111ang d\u1EABn \u0111\u1ED9i qu\xE2n tinh nhu\u1EC7 cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng t\u1EDBi. \u0110\xE2y s\u1EBD l\xE0 tr\u1EADn quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh."
  tutorialHints:
  - "\u0110\u1ECBch t\u1EDBi t\u1EEB <b>ba h\u01B0\u1EDBng</b>. Hai th\xE1p canh c\xF3 s\u1EB5n b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh l\xE2u \u0111\xE0i \u2014 h\xE3y n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p ch\xFAng."
  - "D\xF9ng <b>Tu s\u0129</b> \u0111\u1EC3 h\u1ED3i m\xE1u cho \u0111\u1ED9i qu\xE2n trong tr\u1EADn d\xE0i."
  - "M\u1EDBi: <b>Th\xE1p B\xFAa \u0110\u1ECBa Ch\u1EA5n</b> g\xE2y cho\xE1ng m\u1ECDi k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch quanh th\xE1p. <b>Qu\u1EF7 Fury</b> bi\u1EBFt bay \u2014 ch\u1EC9 Th\xE1p Cung, Bi S\u1EAFt v\xE0 H\u1ECFa Ng\u1EE5c b\u1EAFn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c."
